{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30606","headline":"和主司王起 · 张道符","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三开文镜继芳声，暗暗云霄接去程。\n会压洪波先得路，早陞清禁共垂名。\n莲峰对处朱轮贵，金榜传时玉韵成。\n更许下才听白雪，一枝今过郄诜荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张道符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}